01:01:14.580 --> 01:01:17.660
The studio told the director they thought this was ridiculous.

1471
01:01:17.980 --> 01:01:19.680
They said a bus can't jump a bridge.

1472
01:01:19.840 --> 01:01:22.180
But the director fought really hard for this moment.

1473
01:01:22.400 --> 01:01:32.740
He said, listen, we need a big climactic moment for this bus and a big emotional moment where everyone is terrified and then they feel like relief and victory almoSt.

1474
01:01:33.240 --> 01:01:37.220
Now, to do this in real life, like we said, they stripped down the bus.

1475
01:01:37.320 --> 01:01:38.740
They made it super duper light.

1476
01:01:38.980 --> 01:01:42.580
And they had stunt driver Joffrey Brown do this jump for real.

