1480
01:01:54.280 --> 01:02:03.080
And their biggest concern was that when the bus hit the ground, that that pressure would compress his spine and maybe break his spine.

1481
01:02:03.640 --> 01:02:15.080
So the stunt coordinator designed a special suspension safety harness to keep this from happening so that when the bus landed, he would be in like this like safety thing.

1482
01:02:15.260 --> 01:02:16.300
I'm doing the motion.

1483
01:02:16.300 --> 01:02:17.460
No one can see me.

1484
01:02:17.600 --> 01:02:18.300
I can see it.

1485
01:02:18.400 --> 01:02:19.460
You see what I'm doing.

1486
01:02:19.820 --> 01:02:20.380
It's selling it.

1487
01:02:20.480 --> 01:02:20.980
Thank you.

1488
01:02:20.980 --> 01:02:29.740
But then the other thing that they were concerned about was that they had some cameras that they were afraid might snap off their rigs and crush the driver.

1489
01:02:29.900 --> 01:02:32.380
But they rehearsed this for two weeks.

1490
01:02:32.560 --> 01:02:32.880
They did.

1491
01:02:33.160 --> 01:02:40.820
They also put Joffrey, the driver, in the middle of the bus in like this cage, like you said, with this suspension bungee thing.

1492
01:02:41.240 --> 01:02:46.260
Because that way, if the bus compressed in the front or the back, he would be in the center of it.

1493
01:02:46.260 --> 01:02:51.880
But they also had super suspension shocks on the bus to absorb some of that as well.

1494
01:02:52.360 --> 01:02:53.860
And here's what Jan said.

1495
01:02:54.060 --> 01:03:02.160
He said the effects people told him that the bus would only go about 30 feet max because the bus was just too big to jump any further than that.

1496
01:03:02.280 --> 01:03:05.480
So he set his cameras up with that measurement in mind.

1497
01:03:05.680 --> 01:03:06.880
And there were like a ton.

1498
01:03:06.880 --> 01:03:07.560
Yeah.

1499
