01:03:22.300 --> 01:03:25.340
They could not believe how far this bus actually flew.

1502
01:03:25.600 --> 01:03:28.940
At its highest point, the front of it was 20 feet in the air.

1503
01:03:29.120 --> 01:03:30.600
It actually went out of frame.

1504
01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:32.340
You can see that in the movie.

1505
01:03:32.500 --> 01:03:32.660
Yeah.

1506
01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:33.300
Yes.

1507
01:03:33.380 --> 01:03:36.080
It went far more vertical than they expected.

1508
01:03:36.920 --> 01:03:41.900
And in reality, the bus stayed in the air for 0.49 seconds.

1509
01:03:42.100 --> 01:03:50.640
But because they had all of these cameras and then they kind of slowed down the speed of the film, it stays in the air for 11 seconds in the movie.

1510
01:03:51.160 --> 01:03:55.940
Jan went on to say he really wanted to be able to show the passengers of the bus reacting to the landing.

